{"id":"chatcmpl-9a96ee93-d64b-4a31-93d8-81c8435b276b","object":"chat.completion","created":1795249367,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task resolves laterality ambiguity in medical imaging by cross-checking anatomical orientation markers against the visual evidence before committing to an answer. The successful strategy combined an expert-consultation step to establish orientation conventions with a targeted localization step to confirm the finding's position. The key insight is that side-dependent findings require explicit verification of the image's left/right convention rather than assuming standard orientation.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"For side-dependent findings, first establish the image's orientation convention (e.g., laterality markers) before interpreting position.\",\n    \"Use a domain-expert consultation to resolve ambiguity about conventions, then confirm with a direct localization/grounding step.\",\n    \"When two options differ only by a spatial attribute (left vs right), explicitly verify that attribute rather than relying on default assumptions.\",\n    \"Cross-validate the final answer by reconciling the orientation marker, the visual location, and the localization coordinates into a single consistent explanation.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Always check for orientation markers (L/R labels) before assigning laterality; treat image-left as patient-right unless proven otherwise.\",\n    \"Binary spatial-choice questions\": \"Isolate the single differing attribute between options and verify it directly with a targeted tool call.\",\n    \"Multi-tool verification\": \"Pair a reasoning/expert tool for conventions with a grounding tool for concrete localization, then reconcile both in the final rationale.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the image's laterality convention (marker or standard) before deciding left vs right.\",\n    \"Verify the finding's location with a localization/grounding step and ensure it matches the chosen option.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":472,"total_tokens":825,"completion_tokens":353,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":472},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":353}}}